# Gate Flags Directory

This directory contains flag files that certify a WAVE or GATE has passed successfully.

Flags are created automatically by post-hooks when tests pass 100%.

Example flags:
- wave-1-complete.flag - Domain layer complete
- wave-2-complete.flag - Application layer complete
- wave-3-complete.flag - API layer complete
- wave-4-complete.flag - Frontend complete
- integration-tests-complete.flag - Integration tests 100%
- e2e-tests-complete.flag - E2E tests 100%
- wave-5-complete.flag - WAVE 5 complete
